   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BDA201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.6</span>\n<h2>Student tasks & constructive questions</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">The rules you are held to (attendance, preparation, exam eligibility) — verbatim.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14391 · Decision 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 07/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BDA201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.6</span>\n<h2>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên & câu hỏi kiến tạo</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Những quy định bạn phải tuân theo (chuyên cần, chuẩn bị bài, điều kiện dự thi) — nguyên văn.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14391 · QĐ 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 07/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student tasks (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>- Students must attend more than 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.<br><br>- Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments and labs given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time<br><br>- Use laptop in class only for learning purpose<br><br>- Promptly access to the <a href=\"http://flm.fpt.edu.vn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://flm.fpt.edu.vn</a> for up-to-date course information</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>- Students must attend more than 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.<br><br>- Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments and labs given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time<br><br>- Use laptop in class only for learning purpose<br><br>- Promptly access to the <a href=\"http://flm.fpt.edu.vn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://flm.fpt.edu.vn</a> for up-to-date course information</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions (20)</h3>\n<p>Questions the syllabus asks you to think through before or during the session — try answering them yourself first.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo (20)</h3>\n<p>Câu hỏi syllabus yêu cầu bạn suy nghĩ trước/trong buổi học — tự trả lời trước khi xem bài.</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>Session<br><small>Buổi</small></th><th>Code<br><small>Mã</small></th><th>Question (verbatim)<br><small>Câu hỏi (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td>CQ1</td><td>Translate a practical business question into a basic analytics workflow by identifying the decision to be supported, the data needed, the preparation and visualization steps, and the type of insight managers can use.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td>CQ2</td><td>Frame a business analytics problem by identifying the decision context, stakeholders, available data, analytics objective, and basic ethical or privacy risks.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td>CQ3</td><td>Identify data types, measurement scales, data sources, and file formats in business or financial datasets, and explain how these choices affect later analysis.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td>CQ4</td><td>Import, inspect, clean, transform, and document a simple business dataset using guided Excel, Python, or R workflows.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td>CQ5</td><td>Use descriptive statistics to summarize business performance, variability, outliers, and relationships among variables.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td>CQ6</td><td>Choose and create appropriate visualizations for business data, and explain how chart design can clarify or mislead business interpretation.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td>CQ7</td><td>Use basic probability and uncertainty concepts to describe business or financial risks in practical decision situations.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td>CQ8</td><td>Interpret confidence intervals and simple hypothesis tests as evidence for business comparisons, without relying on advanced mathematical derivations.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td>CQ9</td><td>Build and interpret a simple linear regression model for a business or financial prediction problem using guided software output.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td>CQ10</td><td>Interpret a multiple regression model with business variables, including coefficient meaning, model fit, and limitations of prediction.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td>CQ11</td><td>Diagnose and improve a regression analysis by checking basic assumptions, unusual observations, and practical usefulness for decision-making.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td>CQ12</td><td>Create and interpret a basic time-series forecast using trend, seasonality, and simple model-selection logic.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>13</td><td>CQ13</td><td>Explain the data-mining workflow by preparing training and validation data and choosing suitable performance measures for a business prediction task.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>14</td><td>CQ14</td><td>Apply an introductory classification method, such as logistic regression, k-nearest neighbors, or naïve Bayes, and interpret prediction results in business terms.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>15</td><td>CQ15</td><td>Use introductory decision trees, clustering, or association rules to discover useful customer, product, or market patterns.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>16</td><td>CQ16</td><td>Construct a spreadsheet decision model and use what-if, goal-seek, or scenario analysis to compare business alternatives.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>17</td><td>CQ17</td><td>Use Monte Carlo simulation to model uncertainty and communicate likely outcome ranges for a business or financial decision.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>18</td><td>CQ18</td><td>Formulate and solve a basic linear programming problem by defining decision variables, an objective function, and practical constraints.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>19</td><td>CQ19</td><td>Interpret basic optimization applications, such as budgeting, transportation, assignment, workforce scheduling, or facility-location decisions.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>20</td><td>CQ20</td><td>Complete and defend a guided business analytics project by connecting problem framing, data preparation, method selection, findings, limitations, and recommendations.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14391\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14391</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14391\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14391</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
